      "tactic_notes": "<h2><!--{cke_protected}{C}%3C!%2D%2D%20x-tinymce%2Fhtml%20%2D%2D%3E--><strong>Elder Yaro(87)</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Lesnimir Village Chief】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The Village Chief of Lesnimir, he is the oldest person in the village, initially part of the original tribe of people who inhabits this area. As an elder, he is often free most of the day, but villagers come to him for advice and resolving dispute dispute</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Character Notes】</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Quiet Wisdom</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Elder Yaro exude a quiet Wisdom, earned through a lifetime of experience and ovservations, His calm demeanor reassure villagers during time of uncertainty</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Seniority</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Elder Yaro is the oldest person in the village, he is part of the original people who inhabits this part of the Winterland, as such people in the village respect his decision and counsel.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Adopted Daughter</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">​​​​​​​Many years back, Elder Yaro adopted a small girl and named her \"Vila\". He find this girl crying in Lesnistrom Forest, He was a strict parent but love the girl very much.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Inner Conflict</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Elder Yaro adopted daughter Vila is seen performing magic and label as a Witch by the village, as such, she has fled the village. The Empire has a rules to hand over any Magic user found within its border, Due to this, Elder Yaro is conflict between upholding the tradition for the safety of the village or the safety of his adopted grand daughter.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Favourite Food】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>\"Borscht\"</strong>&nbsp;This is a nourishing and comforting soup made primarily from beets, which are known for their health benefits and mild flavor. The soup is often cooked with vegetables like carrots, potatoes, and cabbage</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【View on Magic】</strong></p>\n<p>As an elder, Yaro can somewhat see through the empire anti-magic propaganda but he also acknowledge the danger the empire poses to the village if it was found out that they sheltered a Witch.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Sample Dialog】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Greeting travelers, I am Yaro, the village elder\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"it's probably not much for you city folk but do enjoy your stay in our humble village\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Oh, while your here how about taking a stroll around the village and getting to know our residents? Unfortunately, I can't give you a tour, I'm afraid I'm a bit too old for that...haha..\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><em>About Vila</em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"So you've heard...I have to say, I've be through a lot....but this is the only time I feel so lost in the dark\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬 \"Harboring a Witch can be a major offense to the empire, I've always put the well being of the village first, but yet....I couldn't just turn my grand daughter in...\"</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-cke-filler-webkit=\"end\" data-cke-temp=\"1\">&nbsp;</div>",
